 "note": "Backfilled from this repository's own commit history of bids.json on 2026-08-31, and again on 2026-09-08 after the sessions of 1-8 September were found missing: tools/update-prices.mjs wrote this file on every run and the workflow's `git add` did not name it, so nothing was ever committed. Keys are EXCHANGE TRADE DATES, which roll at 19:00 Central, not calendar days; weekends hold no session. A snapshot is only filed when the board's own pricedAt falls inside the same trade date, so a frozen board contributes nothing. Every value is the last cash price posted in that session, read from the file as it was committed. Nothing estimated."
